  {
   "id": "dungeon-antiqua-2-384193@major-2026-01-12",
   "gameId": "dungeon-antiqua-2-384193",
   "displayName": "2026/01/12 Update (Full Version)",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-01-12T07:15:22.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "\\ The party reincarnation feature has been enabled by defeating the boss in the post-clearance area under specific conditions. Reincarnation is a feature that allows you to start a new adventure by inheriting the character's job, skill points, and equipment. However, your level will reset to 1, and items and event flags will be initialized.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In ver.20260111, a bug that caused occasional freezing when shopping at the \"General Merchant\" has been fixed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The movement of specific enemy symbols on the field has been reviewed. (We apologize, but this review is in a direction that is disadvantageous to the player.)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "When a character dies or is paralyzed at the end of a battle and the formation is disrupted, the formation will now automatically recover by reviving or healing with spells, etc.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "There was an error in the description of the skill \"Detection\" which has been corrected. (The description stated \"Reveals floor and chest traps\" but there are no traps on the floor in the first place.)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Regarding the skill \"Battlemind\" a bug where the critical hit special or additional effect activation rate was inadvertently lowered has been fixed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "(Added 20260112-2) Regarding the reincarnation function, we have added a fix because there was a bug in the function to select the reincarnation source slot.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "digest": {
